				},
				{
					"id": 205110402,
					"content": "找到了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						205110403
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 205110403,
					"content": "這就是嗎？怎麼看起來，沒什麼不一樣…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						205110404
					],
					"speakerTitle": "安東尼"
				},
				{
					"id": 205110404,
					"content": "無論怎麼看，這都是普通的樹莓啊…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						205110405
					],
					"speakerTitle": "安東尼"
				},
				{
					"id": 205110405,
					"content": "算了，既然人家醫生都這麼開方子了，我就按照藥方上面寫的來做吧。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						205110406
					],
					"speakerTitle": "安東尼"
				},
				{
					"id": 205110406,
					"content": "#謝謝{F#妳}{M#你}，這些是給{F#妳}{M#你}的辛苦費。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						205110407
					],
					"speakerTitle": "安東尼"
				},
				{
					"id": 205110407,
					"content": "#以後說不定還會麻煩{F#妳}{M#你}，{F#妳}{M#你}可千萬別推辭啊。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "安東尼"
				}
